text = "After all packages have been delivered the Helicopter arrives to evacuate any remaining workers. After ~90 seconds the helicopter will take off and if ANYBODY (traitor included) is on board then the Innocents will win. Be careful though as the attack waves will come constantly during the evacuation."
autowrap_mode = 2

